<title>USA: Union sees possible 97 impact from Allied.</title>
<headline>Union sees possible 97 impact from Allied.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Corp said on Tuesday that one of its subsidiaries, Allied Bond &amp; Collection Agency Inc, is pursuing several business opportunities that could have a significant impact later in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the unit saw a significant increase in operating income in first quarter of fiscal 1997 compared to the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>Union Corp said that first quarter earnings rose to $0.26 per share compared to $0.19 a year ago.</p>
